210
00:11:08,490 --> 00:11:09,720
the All-Seer,

211
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:11,560
and the Cloud Celestial Couple.

212
00:11:12,290 --> 00:11:13,760
But no one knew

213
00:11:14,130 --> 00:11:15,480
that Qing Lin's cave world

214
00:11:15,490 --> 00:11:17,520
has 4 fake caves and a single real cave.

215
00:11:18,170 --> 00:11:19,810
The place we went to

216
00:11:19,930 --> 00:11:21,760
is the fourth fake cave.

217
00:11:22,330 --> 00:11:24,440
You were eager to claim the fake cave

218
00:11:24,690 --> 00:11:26,760
