224
00:11:38,250 --> 00:11:39,520
Claim all 4 fake caves

225
00:11:39,850 --> 00:11:41,440
and the real cave will appear.

226
00:11:43,930 --> 00:11:46,320
The Blood Ancestor sure is cunning.

227
00:11:47,250 --> 00:11:50,480
